Run this command in your terminal in the directory OpenShot was downloaded to verify the SHA256 checksum:
  echo "277b27aae97080a1dae8831be8c6d2c576377292f559fb1b94675f6db24aa70f  OpenShot-v4.0.0-x86_64.AppImage" | shasum -a 256 --check

You should get the following output:
  OpenShot-v4.0.0-x86_64.AppImage: OK